## Common errors

| Message | Meaning | What to do |
|---------|---------|------------|
| `No keyword with name '…' found` | keyword unknown | check the spelling; is a `Resource` import missing? |
| `Resource file '…' does not exist` | wrong path | always start tests in the project folder (`${EXECDIR}`) |
| `Element … not found` / timeout | element not found | check the selector in the page object{% if include_web or include_accessibility %}, watch with `-p headed`{% endif %} |
| `Variable '${…}' not found` | variable not defined | create it in `main.resource`, the ability or the page |
| `Connection refused` | service not reachable | check environment, proxy and VPN |
| Tests pass locally but not in CI | different settings | reproduce locally with `-p ci` |

## Glossary

| Term | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| **Keyword** | reusable step. Comes from a library or is written by yourself. |
| **Keyword-driven** | test cases are sequences of keywords with arguments |
| **Library** | collection of ready-made keywords, e.g. for browsers or databases |
| **Ability** | imports a library and holds its settings |
| **Page object** | file with the selectors of one page |
| **Interaction** | technical helper step that uses the library (tag `interaction`, not used in tests) |
| **Task** | action used in a test |
| **Assertion** | check used in a test |
| **Selector (locator)** | description of how an element is found |
| **Setup / teardown** | steps before or after a test, e.g. start and close the browser |
| **Profile** | named execution setting in `robot.toml` |
| **Tag** | label on tests or keywords to select or mark them |

